4
00:01:51,345 --> 00:01:54,344
Hi . I 'm Elise . You must be Lorraine .

5
00:01:54,345 --> 00:01:57,685
Yes . Nice to meet you . I 'm sorry it 's so late .

6
00:01:57,705 --> 00:02:00,904
