10
00:02:15,665 --> 00:02:16,743
Ahoy , Carl ! ( GASPS )

11
00:02:16,945 --> 00:02:18,023
( CHUCKLES )

12
00:02:18,505 --> 00:02:20,697
Elise , thank you for coming .

13
00:02:21,225 --> 00:02:24,224
