47
00:04:12,625 --> 00:04:15,664
A few . One kid lives next door .

48
00:04:15,665 --> 00:04:17,317
That must be fun .

49
00:04:17,865 --> 00:04:22,365
Is there anything you don 't like about living in this house ?

50
00:04:28,105 --> 00:04:29,840
