97
00:08:48,105 --> 00:08:50,249
I saw what haunts him , and it 's not a friend .

98
00:08:50,265 --> 00:08:54,184
It 's a parasite . I 've never felt such a malignant presence .

99
00:08:54,185 --> 00:08:56,235
