213
00:18:04,925 --> 00:18:06,800
Go farther back . Okay .

214
00:18:07,665 --> 00:18:10,021
So , what do you think of this ?

215
00:18:11,265 --> 00:18:12,595
I think it 's stupid .

216
00:18:12,625 --> 00:18:13,996
Hey .

